==Bosnian==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Slavic|čьlověkъ||čelověkъ|lang=bs}}.

===Noun===
'''čovjek''' {{m}} ({{p}}: '''[[ljudi]]''')

# [[person]]
# [[man]]
# [[human]]

*Note: ''This word is irregular. '''Čovjek''' (man) is the singular form of the plural word '''[[ljudi]]''' (men).''

